Licensing summary
=================

The code translated from the R package qrng retains the upstream license choice:

    GPL-2 | GPL-3

Copies of GPL version 2 and GPL version 3 are provided as
LICENSE-GPL-2.txt and LICENSE-GPL-3.txt.

The supplied r_mod helper module is separately MIT-licensed.  See
LICENSE-r_mod-MIT.txt and PORTING_NOTES.md.

The original qrng DESCRIPTION and computational C sources are retained under
upstream/ for provenance and attribution.
